WEBVTT

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.850
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.380
In this wide world

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.550
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:35.130
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:38.760
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:45.870
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.840
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:56.150
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:58.910
Awaken now

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:12.200
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:19.470
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.240
It's certain

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:26.610
Woh woh

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.380
It'll come... It won't.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.490
It'll come... It won't.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.690
It'll come... It won't.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.520
It'll come... It won't.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.890
A phone call will... come!

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.240
It's taking too long!

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.970
Too long! It's taking too long!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.840
When am I ever going to get a phone call?!

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:04.750
How could I, the Earth Help Center's
#1 goddess, with my magnificent skills,

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.620
be without any clients?

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:15.960
Still... This frustration will just make me
all the MORE enthusiastic.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:24.630
Step right up! I shall grant
your each and every wish!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:34.280
Ah! I Shall Grant Your Wish!

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.280
TARIKI HONGANTEMPLE

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.190
Is it too cold for you here?

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.820
Shall we go back inside?

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:44.890
Uh... Nah, I'm okay.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.550
Anyhow... Here, take a look.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.220
Oh!

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.070
They turned out so nicely.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.800
I didn't think they'd make her this happy.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:08.380
I have you to thank for this, too, Megumi.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.820
What's with you two?

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.910
You've been holding hands all day.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.090
Well, it's just that...

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.610
What brings you here at such
a busy time anyway?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.330
This.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.360
A... camera?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.270
Yeah! Actually, I just bought a new one,

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.200
so I thought if I passed this one along to you...

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:26.730
I don't have the money for it.
So I thought if I passed this one along to you...

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:27.740
I don't have the money for it.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.940
If I recall, you don't have
a camera, do you, Kei-chan?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.840
So what?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:35.340
Well, here we are with New Year's
right around the corner,

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.640
and you won't have any pictures of
your girl decked out in a kimono.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.850
I don't think that's something YOU
need to be worrying about!

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:43.380
Yeah, but I'm sure that you'll miss not having

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.840
a single memorable picture of
the two of you together!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.390
What I'm saying is, a camera is a
must-have for a couple in love!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.600
So whaddya say?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.200
Okay, I'm going to take one!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.170
Jeez... Talk about a little sister who
really cares about her brother!

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.150
Except that 30,000 yen wasn't
easy to part with...

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.920
Um, Keiichi?

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:17.910
Look.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:24.320
Ah! I'll bet Urd took this picture...
But when did she get a hold of the camera?

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.090
Pictures are so nice, aren't they?

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:30.330
When you sit here looking at them like this,

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.030
it's not just memories you feel, but the
warmth from those times as well.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:41.010
Well, anyhow that sure was crazy
back then, wasn't it?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.840
Hasegawa returned to normal
the very next morning,

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.810
but our hands still wouldn't come apart.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.790
Well, at least they did come apart
the morning after that.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:55.310
If they hadn't, I can't imagine what
Skuld might have done.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:02.560
I'm sure the reason our hands wouldn't
separate is because I didn't WANT to let go.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:07.170
Well, I guess the same goes for me...

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.200
It's funny, isn't it?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.670
Because this is all it takes to connect us.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.450
The time has finally come for
you to test the sharpness

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:30.150
of this space-time-cutting chainsaw,
"Texas Murder"!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.950
I think I get the idea without
having to test it out.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:36.160
Oh, are you going to help out
with the gardening?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.790
I don't think that's what she's getting at...

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.400
All right, have you said your
prayers, Keiichi?!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.540
Wait a minute, Skuld!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.230
You can give all the excuses you want in hell!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.810
Okay, I think this is overdoing it just a bit.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:51.810
Urd!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:55.270
Ah! Look what you've done to Texas Murder!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.590
Good grief...

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.150
Texas Murder!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.890
These turned out nice.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.930
Well, it's only because I had a great model.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.630
It's because you're a great photographer!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.360
My poor little Murder!
It's because you're a great photographer!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.030
My poor little Murder!
Aww, shucks...

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.130
My poor little Murder!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.830
That's not what I mean.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:24.180
I know! Let's show these
fabulous photos to Megumi!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.250
Lessee, I think Megumi's home phone was...

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:50.140
Ah, hello? Hey, it's me.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:54.670
Hello! This is the Earth Help Center!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:56.540
Huh?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.880
Fortunately for you,

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:01.580
you have just been authorized to
receive assistance from a goddess.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.810
I shall be there shortly to discuss your
needs, so please wait one moment!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.190
I am pleased to meet you!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.330
I am a member of the Earth Help Center,

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.370
Goddess First Class, Second Category,
Unlimited License.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:30.500
I am the goddess Peorth, at your service!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.120
This can't be happening.
I called ANOTHER one?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.260
Oh, it has been so long since my last client,
I can't wait to put my skills to use!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.260
Pose!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.760
Maybe this is a better one.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:46.690
Or perhaps I look sexier THIS way...

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.000
I shall grant whatever it is you desire!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.020
Hey, tell me which pose you
think is best here!

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:56.870
Um... Have you come to grant me
a wish by any chance?

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.810
Oh, yes, yes, YES! That's right!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:04.900
I heard the cries of your heart and
have descended from Heaven!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.480
I shall grant that wish your heart harbors!

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:14.220
Um, actually I'm pretty much
covered as far as goddesses go...

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.120
Huh?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:18.190
Keiichi! If you're calling Megumi,

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.130
then tell her to bring over the
Great Space War video.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.220
Oh, and... huh?

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:24.600
Urd?!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.700
Peorth?!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.640
Wh-What are you doing here?!

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.730
I might ask you the same question!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.440
Hey, Keiichi, would you tell
Megumi to bring back

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.410
the outer space soldering iron I leant her...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.410
Huh?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.950
P-PEORTH?!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.350
Skuld, TOO?!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.450
How could this be?!

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.580
TWO goddesses? What the heck is
going on with this place?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.890
Uh, well actually...

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:50.220
Oh, Keiichi?

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:53.320
Shall we make some reprints for Megumi?

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.230
Belldandy?!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.460
Oh! Peorth!

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.930
It's been so long! What brings you
here out of the blue?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.470
Peorth?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.580
Would you mind not acting so
"buddy-buddy" with me?

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:14.240
Or have you forgotten that my
organization and yours are rivals?

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.490
Don't be like that...
Not after we've finally met again!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:21.480
ANYWAY, I have come here only because
I was summoned by that individual.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.460
What? Keiichi called her?

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.730
No, it couldn't be!

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.730
No, uh, you see...

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.500
the phone connected me to
Heaven on its own!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:32.800
I didn't call her because I WANTED to!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.200
I get it now.
I didn't call her because I WANTED to!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:34.830
I didn't call her because I WANTED to!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:40.570
Well, no matter. All else aside,
my job is simply to grant his wish.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.780
All right, let's hear your wish!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:46.230
I shall grant just one wish,
which can be anything you like.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.820
Hmm... Don't have one.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.520
Oh, come on now!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.710
I know what you really want deep down!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.590
Then how about if I just ask you to go back?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:05.030
Secret technique: Storm of Roses!

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.630
Ouch, they prickle!

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.410
I'm afraid I cannot afford to
be made a fool of.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:18.140
I did not come here to grant
such an absurd wish.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.850
This must be terrible for you, too,

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.250
being caught by such an
indecisive client and all...

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:27.210
At this rate, I guess you'll never
be able to return to Heaven, huh?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.250
Not at all.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:33.230
I have a contract with Keiichi.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.730
What did you say?!

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.860
Then why don't you return?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.970
Your contract must be fulfilled, right?

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:42.070
Well, it's all because I made
an unreasonable wish.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.500
Unreasonable wish?

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.950
"I'd like a goddess like you to
always stay by my side"?!

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.880
You must be joking!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.580
It's too much! It's so funny
I'm tossing flowers!

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.610
It's unbelievable!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.060
She's getting a kick out of it, huh?

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.730
You're being laughed at, Keiichi.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.630
Oh, shut up...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.120
You couldn't be... serious?

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:15.840
I'm sure it's registered in
Yggdrasil's system, too.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.270
Why not try putting in an inquiry?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:26.680
Keiichi's wish really was registered there.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:31.350
And now it's going to end up
becoming a double contract.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:35.590
Then our contract is invalid, right?!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:36.720
No.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:41.600
There is no regulation on double contracts.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:46.360
Since the odds of placing two such calls
are so low to begin with.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:53.040
Besides, a First Class deity simply does not
return to Heaven empty-handed

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.740
after being summoned to grant a wish.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.780
But I don't HAVE any wishes!

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:03.440
You are simply not aware of your own desire.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.990
I am not going back.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.390
Not until I hear your real wish.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:16.400
And what the heck is that supposed to be?

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:24.410
Don't you worry, Belldandy.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:27.670
I'll think up some reasonable wish
so we can have her go back.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.480
Oh, I'm not worried about that.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.410
It'll be all right.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:43.750
Fate has led us to the same client, Belldandy.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:49.550
I'm sure I heard it...
a suppressed desire of the flesh.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:55.730
I'll do whatever it takes
to grant that wish...

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:10.150
Fast as wind, silent as the forest,
daring as fire, stable as a mountain.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.350
Fast as wind, silent as the forest,
daring as fire, stable as a mountain.
This is no good either...

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.620
"Please compile the results of the experiment."

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.350
Guess I can't ask anyone for help
on that kind of stuff...

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:22.200
"Please turn this radio/cassette
player into a CD player!"

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.430
I don't even have any CDs, though.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:27.740
"Please let Rossi win the
Championship this year, too!"

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.700
That'll probably make her angry...

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:36.080
I know! How about "please bring
back Beta tapes"...

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.710
Damn... Are these lame wishes
all I can come up with?

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:47.210
Keiichi's wish...

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.090
I'm making too much of this.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.130
It'll be all right.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.990
Keiichi!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.830
Dinner's ready!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.600
I'll be right there!

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:16.480
This basically means I'm not
unhappy with my lifestyle.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.480
Oh, is that right?

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:21.890
It doesn't look that way to ME at all...

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:23.580
Well, I'm telling you that's how it is!

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:28.460
In any case, I've kept you waiting.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:30.090
Please come this way!

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:39.110
Who the heck is going to eat all this?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.670
I have prepared it all for you.

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:45.010
I'm sorry, but I can't eat it.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:48.020
Besides, Belldandy's already
got dinner ready for me...

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:50.920
Oh, no, you will be eating this!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.180
After all...

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.790
They all...

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.850
...want to be eaten so badly!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:06.960
So please eat up, and don't hold back!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.210
I am so good!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.980
Now that's the kind of technique only a
First Class Goddess could manage.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.280
What are you doing?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:24.150
Huh? Urd?! What did you come here for?!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:28.020
I thought I'd fulfill the divine obligation
that Belldandy has shirked.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:31.220
It looks to me like you're
torturing him a bit.

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.960
Thanks for the meal. It was delicious...

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.800
There! See how delighted Keiichi is?

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.460
Listen. I don't think what you're doing
is going to have any effect.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.300
And what do you mean by that?

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.470
Here.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.200
Is this picture supposed to mean something?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.050
It's a nice shot, isn't it?

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.570
What, are you just showing off your
younger sister or something?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.250
That's not it!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:01.590
Belldandy's smile looks really pure
and honest, doesn't it?

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:07.220
She only shows that face to
people she truly trusts.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.830
So what the heck is that...

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.060
What's more...

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.290
Look.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.070
Oh, is that right?

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.170
Well, Nekomi Park is nice and big, after all.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.070
I hope it's nice out.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:23.370
I'm sure it'll be fine as long
as you're with me.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:26.040
As long as YOU'RE with ME!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.570
I appreciate the meal!

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:35.150
It can't be... After all he ate
just a moment ago?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.680
That's just the kind of guy Keiichi is.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:43.060
No matter how stuffed he is,
if Belldandy has made food for him,

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.070
he can eat however much there may be.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.690
In a way, he's the ultimate softy.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:54.100
But you know, it's because he's like that
that Belldandy puts so much faith in him.

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:57.740
That's why nothing you do
will make any difference.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.710
As far as their relationship is concerned...

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:05.210
Well now, I suppose I'll go whip up
some stomach medicine for Keiichi.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.280
They have faith in each other?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.280
That can't be!

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:15.030
Belldandy has not fulfilled her obligation!

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.360
THAT is the reason why I received
that phone call!

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:23.570
I will by no means be defeated by
the likes of Belldandy!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.410
I give up!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.110
I've gotta think of a wish quick.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.240
I won't last at this rate...

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.970
Keiichi.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.010
I'll wash your back for you.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.790
B-Belldandy!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.480
You're being awfully aggressive today!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.780
If this has something to do with Peorth,
I've thought of my wish!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:50.790
I thought it'd be nice if she could
change this bath into a hot spring.

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:52.430
What do you think?

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.830
No lying, you.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.730
That isn't what you REALLY want, now is it?

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:05.110
What the heck are you doing here?!

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:07.880
It should be perfectly obvious!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:10.620
I came here to wash your back.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:15.060
Allow me to provide you with more impeccable
service than Belldandy could ever offer.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:17.160
She hasn't provided me with
any "services" like this!

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:19.630
You needn't be so shy.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:26.190
I shall give you a very telling lesson of what
a First Class goddess's techniques are like.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:27.770
Waugh! Cut it out!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.370
There's nothing to be so embarrassed about!
Waugh! Cut it out!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.360
There's nothing to be so embarrassed about!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.070
Sorry!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:39.210
I will see to it that no matter what,

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:42.770
I will be the one to grant
that wish, not Belldandy!

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.650
It's no use. I just can't think of anything.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.080
But... that did feel kinda nice...

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.830
If only it had been Belldandy...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.660
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.700
What is it this time?

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:03.960
I shall change your clothing into something
that will stir women's hearts!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.810
I'd rather you not.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.930
There we go!

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.680
Ah! A pink, silk nightgown!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:20.050
Wearing this will make Keiichi a
love hunter tonight for sure!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.560
I beg you, PLEASE put me back to normal!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.660
Even when it looks so delicious?

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.920
Just put me back to the way I was!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.960
What the heck does she mean, "love hunter"?

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.830
If she's going to be that persistent,

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:35.170
it's only going to make me afraid
of asking her any wishes...

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:38.470
On the other hand, if things
keep going like this,

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.240
it's only going to be a burden on Belldandy...

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.410
Oh well, I guess I'll call it a day.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.310
Morisato's Room

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:49.540
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:55.120
He's a formidable opponent to have
stood up to my advances so far...

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:58.950
But this time will be different.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:02.120
I will bring this to a decisive end.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.920
Come quickly, Keiichi.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:08.390
I shall indulge you in my TRUE
"customer service."

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:12.140
I guess... I have no choice.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.900
I'll go take cover for a bit.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.970
Belldandy?

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.410
Belldandy?

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:26.820
Keiichi! What are you doing up at this hour?

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.660
Can't you sleep?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:33.730
Well, Peorth has taken over my room,
so I can't go in there.

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:36.660
Do you think you'd mind if I
stayed here for a bit?

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:39.430
That's terrible!
I'll get her out of there!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:42.770
No, it's all right. It looks like she's
already fallen asleep, and well...

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:44.790
I sure can't let her to see Peorth like THAT.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.810
Is that right?

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.980
Then I'll prepare some black tea for you.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:50.000
Sure.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:54.610
So have you decided on the wish
you're going to make to Peorth?

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:57.550
No. I'm having a heck of a time with that...

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:02.460
At first, I thought I'd have her make
this place into a mansion,

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.190
but I actually like it just the way it is...

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:07.630
Thinking up wishes is tough.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:15.630
Keiichi, do you think the wish you made to me
way back then really was the right one?

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:18.800
What makes you ask that all of a sudden?

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:25.140
You being here right now shows that
WAS the right wish, doesn't it?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.780
It might have seemed like a joke,

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:31.010
but at the time there was nothing
else that came to mind.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:33.520
I really felt that way.

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.650
From the bottom of my heart...

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.990
Keiichi...

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.660
So my wish was granted.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:44.590
Yes.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:47.570
It's all right.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:52.900
Because I wouldn't have made that wish...
to anyone... but you.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:05.020
Thank you, Keiichi.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.130
Peorth...

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:19.860
Go on, come at me from any direction!

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:24.660
What's taking him so long anyway?

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:33.940
Woh, it starts to shine

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:50.730
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:59.490
Was the start of the miracles you brought

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:07.640
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:13.250
My new happy life, completely repainted

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.650
In the colors of spring

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.590
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:26.000
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:30.340
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:35.040
Let's create more and more of our miracles

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:42.880
Woh, whatever kind of morning

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:51.390
Woh, it starts to shine

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:54.890
Every day is a miracle

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:59.130
Each of them has a desire to grant wishes.

00:23:59.130 --> 00:24:04.040
But, in trying to accomplish this by any means
possible, her feelings begin to waver.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:04.800
Next time, "Ah! I Want to be of Use to You!"

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:07.370
Ah! I Want to Be of Use to You!
Next time, "Ah! I Want to be of Use to You!"

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.740
Ah! I Want to Be of Use to You!
I'm begging you to please
stop going overboard!
